{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27323","headline":"饮马长城窟 · 陈标","name":"饮马长城窟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日风吹虏骑尘，年年饮马汉营人。\n千堆战骨那知主，万里枯沙不辨春。\n浴谷气寒愁坠指，断崖冰滑恐伤神。\n金鞍玉勒无颜色，泪满征衣怨暴秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}